SUMMARY:Superunknown - The 35 Tour
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 29th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\n2 FULL Albums\n1 GREAT Night \nCelebrate the 35th anniversary of 2 amazing grunge albums – Temple of the Dog and Badmotorfinger. \nInternationally touring Chris Cornell Tribute\, SUPERUNKNOWN presents this -One of a Kind- Double album show. \nSuperunknown has performed all over the world with their unparalleled tribute to Chris Cornell.  In 2026 they will be performing Temple of the Dogs self-titled debut along with Soundgardens groundbreaking\, Badmotorfinger.  \nBoth albums will be performed back to back in their entirety.  \nCheck out Superunknown here!\nWebsite | Facebook\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/superunknown-the-35-tour/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/02/SUPERUNKNOWN-10.18-9-IG.jpg
